<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>商品収益性ダッシュボード - B-Faith Portal</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <style>
    /* ─── 常時 present: 画面ぜんぶで使う見た目 (2026-09-08 作り直し) ───
       ねらい = 「人が見て分かる」。数字は等幅で桁を揃え、良い/悪いは色ではなく
       色 + 記号で示す。表は横に長いので、商品名 (左) と 結果 (右) を貼り付ける */
    :root {
      --ink: #101828; --ink-2: #344054; --muted: #667085; --faint: #98a2b3;
      --line: #e4e7ec; --line-2: #eff1f4; --bg: #f5f6f8; --card: #ffffff;
      --brand: #2563eb; --brand-dark: #1d4ed8;
      --pos: #067647; --pos-bg: #ecfdf3; --neg: #b42318; --neg-bg: #fef3f2;
      --warn: #b54708; --warn-bg: #fffaeb;
      --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,.06), 0 1px 3px rgba(16,24,40,.08);
      --radius: 10px;
      /* 🚨 貼り付けた結果2列の幅。オフセット (right) と幅を同じ値から出さないと、
         中身が広がったときに左の列が右の列に重なる */
      --ep-r-col: 112px;
    }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .container { max-width: 1760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 24px 40px; }
    .header-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .header-row h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: .01em; }
    .page-lead { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    .notice { background: var(--warn-bg); border: 1px solid #fedf89; border-left: 4px solid #f79009;
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #93370d; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .notice-small { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    /* KPI タイル */
    .summary-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 12px 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .card .label { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    .card .value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 650; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--ink);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    .card .sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); margin-top: 2px; }
    .card.danger { border-color: #fecdca; background: linear-gradient(0deg, var(--neg-bg), var(--neg-bg)); }
    .card.danger .value { color: var(--neg); }
    .card.warning { border-color: #fedf89; background: var(--warn-bg); }
    .card.warning .value { color: var(--warn); }
    .card.success { border-color: #abefc6; background: var(--pos-bg); }
    .card.success .value { color: var(--pos); }

    /* タブ = 押せると分かる形にする (下線1本だと押せると気づかれない) */
    .sub-tabs { display: inline-flex; gap: 2px; margin-bottom: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      background: #eceef1; border-radius: 10px; padding: 3px; }
    .sub-tab { padding: 7px 15px; border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-2); border-radius: 8px; transition: background .12s, color .12s; }
    .sub-tab:hover:not(.active) { background: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
    .sub-tab.active { background: var(--card); color: var(--brand); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }

    .filters { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 14px;
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 10px 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .filters label { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .filters select, .filters input { padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid #d0d5dd; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; }
    .filters select:focus, .filters input:focus { outline: 2px solid #b2ccff; outline-offset: -1px; border-color: var(--brand); }

    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 8px 15px; border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; transition: background .12s, box-shadow .12s; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--brand); color: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--brand-dark); }
    .btn-primary:disabled { background: #b2ccff; cursor: not-allowed; box-shadow: none; }
    .btn-export { background: #fff; color: var(--ink-2); border-color: #d0d5dd; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .btn-export:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #f9fafb; }
    .btn-export:disabled { color: var(--faint); cursor: not-allowed; box-shadow: none; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #fff; color: var(--ink-2); border-color: #d0d5dd; }
    .btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #f9fafb; }

    /* 表 */
    .table-wrap { max-height: calc(100vh - 330px); overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--card); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .data-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; font-size: 12.5px; }
    .data-table th, .data-table td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2); padding: 8px 10px;
      text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .data-table th { background: #f8f9fb; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; text-align: right;
      font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-2); cursor: pointer; user-select: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .data-table th:hover { background: #f0f2f5; }
    /* 商品名に幅を寄せる。放っておくとモール列だけ間延びして読みにくい */
    .data-table:not(.ep-table) td:first-child, .data-table:not(.ep-table) th:first-child { width: 30%; }
    /* 文字の列だけ左寄せ。数字は右寄せのまま (ep-table は独自に指定する) */
    .data-table:not(.ep-table) td:nth-child(1), .data-table:not(.ep-table) td:nth-child(2),
    .data-table:not(.ep-table) th:nth-child(1), .data-table:not(.ep-table) th:nth-child(2) { text-align: left; }
    .data-table tbody tr:hover { background: #f7f9ff; }
    .data-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .num-pos { color: var(--pos); font-weight: 650; }
    .num-neg { color: var(--neg); font-weight: 650; }
    .cell-name { max-width: 320px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .cell-code { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; }

    .row-danger { background: var(--neg-bg); }
    .row-danger:hover { background: #fee4e2 !important; }
    .row-warning { background: var(--warn-bg); }
    .row-warning:hover { background: #fef0c7 !important; }
    .row-success { background: var(--pos-bg); }
    .row-success:hover { background: #dcfae6 !important; }

    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }
    .badge-fba { background: #eff4ff; color: #175cd3; }
    .badge-fbm { background: #fffaeb; color: var(--warn); }
    .badge-mall { background: #f2f4f7; color: var(--ink-2); }

    .loading { text-align: center; padding: 48px; color: var(--muted); }
    .empty { text-align: center; padding: 48px; color: var(--faint); }

    .fee-status { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .fee-status .ok { color: var(--pos); font-weight: 600; }
    .fee-status .warn { color: var(--warn); font-weight: 600; }

    /* ─── 想定利益タブ ─── */
    .ep-table { font-size: 12.5px; }
    .ep-table th, .ep-table td { white-space: nowrap; }
    .ep-table .ep-group th { background: #f2f4f7; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 11px; text-align: center;
      font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); top: 0; }
    .ep-table thead tr:nth-child(2) th { top: 29px; }
    /* 🚨 横に長い表なので、商品 (左) と 結果 (右) は貼り付けて常に見えるようにする */
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-l, .ep-table td.ep-stick-l { position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 5; background: var(--card);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; box-shadow: 6px 0 8px -8px rgba(16,24,40,.45); }
    .ep-table thead th.ep-stick-l { z-index: 12; background: #f8f9fb; }
    .ep-table .ep-group th.ep-stick-l { z-index: 13; background: #f2f4f7; }
    /* 🚨 結果は2列とも右に貼る。両方 right:0 にすると重なって片方が読めなくなる */
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-r, .ep-table td.ep-stick-r,
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-r2, .ep-table td.ep-stick-r2 { position: sticky; z-index: 5; background: var(--card); }
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-r2, .ep-table td.ep-stick-r2 { right: var(--ep-r-col); border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: -6px 0 8px -8px rgba(16,24,40,.45); }
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-r, .ep-table td.ep-stick-r { right: 0; }
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-r, .ep-table td.ep-stick-r,
    .ep-table th.ep-stick-r2, .ep-table td.ep-stick-r2 {
      width: var(--ep-r-col); min-width: var(--ep-r-col); max-width: var(--ep-r-col); }
    .ep-table thead th.ep-stick-r, .ep-table thead th.ep-stick-r2 { z-index: 12; background: #f8f9fb; }
    .ep-table .ep-group th.ep-stick-r { z-index: 13; background: #f2f4f7; right: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .ep-table tbody tr:hover td.ep-stick-r2 { background: #f7f9ff; }
    .ep-table tbody tr.row-danger td.ep-stick-r2 { background: var(--neg-bg); }
    .ep-table tbody tr.row-warning td.ep-stick-l, .ep-table tbody tr.row-warning td.ep-stick-r,
    .ep-table tbody tr.row-warning td.ep-stick-r2 { background: var(--warn-bg); }
    .ep-table tbody tr:hover td.ep-stick-l, .ep-table tbody tr:hover td.ep-stick-r { background: #f7f9ff; }
    .ep-table tbody tr.row-danger td.ep-stick-l, .ep-table tbody tr.row-danger td.ep-stick-r { background: var(--neg-bg); }
    .ep-table tbody tr { cursor: pointer; }
    .ep-name { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); max-width: 300px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .ep-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 1px; }
    .ep-margin { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; }
    .ep-none { color: #d0d5dd; }
    .ep-ship { color: var(--ink); }
    .ep-ship-code { color: var(--faint); font-size: 11px; margin-left: 4px; }
    .ep-chip { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 10.5px;
      background: #f2f4f7; color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 600; }
    .ep-chip-warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); }

    .ep-note { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.75; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .ep-note b { color: var(--ink); }
    .ep-note .ep-note-warn { color: var(--warn); }
    .ep-note .ep-note-meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
    .ep-gen { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline; }

    /* 1行ぶんの計算内訳 (行を押すと開く) */
    .ep-detail td { background: #fbfcfe; padding: 0; }
    /* 🚨 表は横に長いので、内訳は左に貼り付けて横スクロールしなくても読めるようにする。
       .data-table td の text-align:right をここで打ち消す (打ち消さないと文字が右端へ飛ぶ) */
    .ep-detail-inner { padding: 14px 18px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 320px) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 28px; white-space: normal; text-align: left; position: sticky; left: 0; max-width: 1180px; }
    .ep-calc { font-size: 12.5px; }
    .ep-calc-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); }
    .ep-calc-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .ep-calc-row.total { font-weight: 700; border-top: 2px solid var(--line); border-bottom: none; margin-top: 4px; padding-top: 8px; }
    .ep-calc-label { color: var(--ink-2); }
    .ep-calc-val { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .ep-facts { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.9; }
    .ep-facts dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
    .ep-facts dd { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--ink); }
<% if (featureFlagEnabled) { %>

    /* ─── 以下、feature flag ON 時のみ出力（Dark Launch 漏れ防止） ─── */
    .impact-cards .card .value { font-size: 20px; }
    .impact-cards .card .sub { font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 2px; }

    .pd-mega-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 3px solid #1e3a8a; }
    .pd-mega-tab { padding: 12px 24px; border: none; background: #e5e7eb; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #4b5563; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; margin-bottom: -3px; }
    .pd-mega-tab.active { color: white; background: #1e3a8a; border-bottom: 3px solid #1e3a8a; }
    .pd-mega-tab:hover:not(.active) { background: #d1d5db; color: #1f2937; }
    .pd-tab-panel { display: none; }
    .pd-tab-panel.active { display: block; }

    .sub-tab .count { font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af; margin-left: 4px; }
    .sub-tab.active .count { color: #2563eb; }

    .pd-flag-chip { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; margin-right: 3px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .pd-chip-ew-drop { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; }
    .pd-chip-ew-insufficient { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    .pd-chip-ew-indeterminate { background: #e0e7ff; color: #3730a3; }
    .pd-chip-ew-skip { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }
    .pd-chip-data-insufficient { background: #fed7aa; color: #9a3412; }
    .pd-chip-seasonality { background: #ccfbf1; color: #115e59; }
    .pd-chip-new-product { background: #ddd6fe; color: #5b21b6; }
    .pd-chip-status { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; border: 1px dashed #3b82f6; }

    .pd-segmented { display: inline-flex; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 3px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .pd-segmented-item { padding: 8px 16px; border: none; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #6b7280; border-radius: 6px; }
    .pd-segmented-item.active { background: white; color: #1e3a8a; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .pd-segmented-item .pd-segment-count { font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af; margin-left: 4px; }
    .pd-segmented-item.active .pd-segment-count { color: #1e3a8a; }

    .pd-modal-backdrop { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 100; }
    .pd-modal-backdrop.open { display: flex; }
    .pd-modal-box { background: white; border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; max-width: 720px; width: 90%; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    .pd-modal-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #1f2937; }
    .pd-modal-row { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
    .pd-modal-row label { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 500; }
    .pd-modal-row input[type=text], .pd-modal-row input[type=number], .pd-modal-row input[type=date], .pd-modal-row textarea, .pd-modal-row select {
      width: 100%; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .pd-modal-row textarea { min-height: 60px; resize: vertical; }
    .pd-modal-grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .pd-modal-section { background: #f9fafb; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .pd-modal-error { color: #b91c1c; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .pd-modal-footer { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .pd-manual-box { max-width: 880px; }
    .pd-manual-h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin: 18px 0 8px; color: #1f2937; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding-left: 8px; }
    .pd-manual-list { margin: 0 0 8px 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: #374151; }
    .pd-manual-list ul { margin: 4px 0 4px 20px; }
    .pd-manual-list code { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; }
    .pd-manual-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin: 6px 0; }
    .pd-manual-table th, .pd-manual-table td { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
    .pd-manual-table th { background: #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600; }
    .pd-manual-table td:first-child { white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
    .pd-status-radio-group { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .pd-status-radio-group label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; }
    .pd-status-radio-group input[type=radio] { margin: 0; }
    .pd-status-radio-group label:has(input:checked) { background: #dbeafe; border-color: #3b82f6; color: #1e40af; font-weight: 600; }

    .pd-threshold-panel { background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: none; }
    .pd-threshold-panel.open { display: block; }
    .pd-threshold-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 10px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
    .pd-threshold-row label { color: #4b5563; }
    .pd-threshold-row input { padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; width: 120px; }
    .pd-threshold-section { margin-bottom: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .pd-threshold-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .pd-threshold-section h3 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 8px; }

    .pd-error-banner { background: #fee2e2; border: 1px solid #dc2626; color: #991b1b; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
<% } %>
  </style>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/mobile.css">
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 🚨 ヘッダはポータル共通の .portal-header を使う。
       2026-09-08 まで .top-nav という style.css に**存在しないクラス**を書いていたため、
       この画面だけヘッダが素のテキストで縦積みになっていた -->
  <header class="portal-header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Portal</a>
      <h1>商品収益性ダッシュボード</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <span class="user-name"><%= displayName || username %></span>
      <a href="/logout" class="btn-logout">Logout</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="header-row">
      <div>
        <h2 id="pd-view-title">粗利ワースト商品</h2>
        <div class="page-lead" id="pd-view-lead">直近の販売実績から、粗利の低い商品を洗い出します</div>
      </div>
<% if (!featureFlagEnabled) { %>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;" id="pd-tab-a-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="loadData()" id="btn-load">データ取得</button>
        <button class="btn btn-export" onclick="exportCSV()" id="btn-export" disabled>CSV出力</button>
      </div>
<% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="notice" id="pd-notice-actual">
      この4つのタブは<b>販売実績ベース</b>の管理指標です (現行原価・現行料率。過去時点の再現値ではありません)。
    </div>

<% if (featureFlagEnabled) { %>
    <!-- ─── 大タブ（feature flag ON 時のみ出力） ─── -->
    <div class="pd-mega-tabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="pd-mega-tab active" data-section="profit" onclick="switchMegaTab('profit')" role="tab">モール別粗利分析</button>
      <button class="pd-mega-tab" data-section="inventory" onclick="switchMegaTab('inventory')" role="tab">在庫整理・撤退判断支援</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── タブA: モール別粗利分析（flag ON: tab-panel でラップ） ─── -->
    <div id="pd-tab-a" class="pd-tab-panel active">
      <div class="header-row" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
        <div></div>
